{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00369","headline":"三学山夜看圣灯 · 蜀太妃徐氏","name":"三学山夜看圣灯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣灯千万炬，旋向碧空生。\n细雨湿不暗，好风吹更明。\n磬敲金地响，僧唱梵天声。\n若说无心法，此光如有情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太妃徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}